# GC573 experiment: delivery below 59.94 Hz (spec/open-questions.md #33)
date:    2026-11-25 04:17-04:27 UTC
vm:      gc573-dev, kernel 6.8.0-151-generic
rev:     21b88dfff751 + the experiment hooks (exp_rate_fps, exp_rate_bits, gc573-cap -M)
source:  host DVI-D-0 (GT 710, NVIDIA 470), ffplay testsrc2 at the mode's rate, full screen; YUYV capture
method:  tests/exp-delivery.sh RATE N TAG: per frame a hash of every word (FRAME) and, after DQBUF and
         before hashing, BAR0 0x300 (runs 1-12) or 0x300-0x3fc (run 13) and 0x1000-0x10fc (REGS)
note:    a run of identical frames longer than the pattern (3 at 50 Hz, 4 at 29.97, 5 at 25/23.98)
         is the source showing one frame for two refreshes (ffplay; 7 % of frames at 60 Hz too)

